## Formal ontology mappings

- **BFO** `bfo:has-participant` — exact semantic match (the canonical "an occurrent had this continuant as a participant" relation)
- **PROV-O** `prov:wasAssociatedWith` — close analogue (PROV-O is more agent-specific)
- **DC Terms** `dcterms:contributor` — partial analogue (one slot of the contribution axis)

